==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|legal}} A [[document]], made by a person when still [[legally]] [[fit]] to do so, which provides clear instructions or principles to be employed by a surrogate decision-maker, such as expressing a [[desire]] to be allowed to [[die]] instead of being kept [[alive]] by [[artificial]] [[mean]]s, in the event of being severely [[disabled]] or suffering from a [[terminal]] [[illness]].
#: {{syn|en|advance directive}}

